// Tipo: flowchart-diagram
// Máquina de estados de uma parcela (Installment).

PENDING [shape: oval, color: gray]
ISSUED [shape: oval, color: blue]
OVERDUE [shape: oval, color: orange]
PAID [shape: oval, color: green]
ISSUE_FAILED [shape: oval, color: red]
CANCELLED [shape: oval, color: black]

PENDING > ISSUED: boleto emitido no Cora
PENDING > ISSUE_FAILED: 3 falhas de emissão
ISSUE_FAILED > PENDING: botão "tentar de novo"
ISSUED > PAID: webhook + consulta confirma
ISSUED > OVERDUE: passou do vencimento
OVERDUE > PAID: pagou atrasado
PENDING > CANCELLED: contrato cancelado
ISSUED > CANCELLED: contrato cancelado (cancela no Cora)
OVERDUE > CANCELLED: contrato cancelado (cancela no Cora)
ISSUE_FAILED > CANCELLED: contrato cancelado
